{
  "name": "StringOps",
  "comment": "8086 string operations — MOVS/CMPS/SCAS/LODS/STOS in byte and word forms. 24.6.7c covers single-iteration semantics; REP/REPE/REPNE prefix machinery (counted-loop wrapping) lands in 24.6.7c2 inside X86JsonCpu.Step().\n\nDirection Flag (DF, FLAGS bit 10) drives SI/DI advance: DF=0 → forward (+N), DF=1 → backward (-N). Default after RESET is DF=0.\n\nSegment usage:\n  MOVS/CMPS/LODS source: DS:SI (segment override applies to source)\n  MOVS/CMPS/SCAS/STOS dest: ES:DI (override does NOT apply per Intel — ES is hardcoded)",
